<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/inventions?focus=coffee">Inventions &amp; Discoveries</a> · Farming and food</p><h1 class="enc-title">Coffee</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">15th century</span> · <a href="/centuries/15th-century">15th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/coffee-economy">Coffee</a> is a drink brewed from the roasted seeds of the coffee plant, which grows wild in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ethiopia">Ethiopia</a>. There is no confirmed evidence of it being drunk before the 15th century, when <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sufism">Sufis</a> in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yemen">Yemen</a> used it to stay alert during night prayers; Abd al-Qadir al-Jaziri reported that Jamal-al-Din al-Dhabhani, mufti of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/aden">Aden</a>, first adopted it around 1454. It reached <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mecca">Mecca</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cairo">Cairo</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/damascus">Damascus</a>, and the first coffeehouse in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/istanbul">Istanbul</a> opened in 1554. Until the end of the 17th century the Yemeni port of Mocha was its only gateway; by 1788 <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/saint-domingue">Saint-Domingue</a> supplied half the world's coffee, and by 1852 <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/brazil">Brazil</a> was the largest producer.</p></div>
<section class="inv-entry"><h2 class="enc-section-title">On the inventions tree</h2><dl class="inv-entry-facts"><div><dt>First known</dt><dd>15th century</dd></div><div><dt>Where</dt><dd>Yemen</dd></div></dl><p class="inv-entry-note"><span class="inv-k">Note</span>The 10th-century physician al-Razi wrote of bunchum, which later accounts say was made from a root. Legends credit the discovery to Kaldi, a 9th-century goatherd, or to the 13th-century Sufi al-Shadhili.</p><p class="enc-article-foot"><a class="enc-random-link" href="/inventions?focus=coffee">See it on the inventions tree &rarr;</a></p></section>
